Q115041081	PREFIX_OK	"Takagi" is a place-name disambiguator (高木) prepended to the English label to distinguish this Hikawa Shrine from the many others; the kana ひかわじんじゃ correctly reflects the shrine's Japanese name 氷川神社 without the location qualifier
